{"id":"2adc36a611449e23","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-limit-properties.md","title":"Solovay Limit-Sentence Properties","display":"lem-solovay-limit-properties — Solovay Limit-Sentence Properties","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-limit-properties","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-limit-properties"],"display":"lem-solovay-limit-properties — Solovay Limit-Sentence Properties","depends_on":["[[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]]","[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-df-solovay-realization]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-limit-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-limit-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-limit-properties — Solovay Limit-Sentence Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b78fd5923bcaa6c\" href=\"?note=3b78fd5923bcaa6c\" title=\"89-thm-sigma-one-completeness\">89-thm-sigma-one-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76b37345e1a3ad95\" href=\"?note=76b37345e1a3ad95\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-self-reference\">89-lem-solovay-self-reference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97b68cd750e79cac\" href=\"?note=97b68cd750e79cac\" title=\"89-df-solovay-realization\">89-df-solovay-realization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,H,S_0,\\ldots,S_n,W&#39;,R&#39;\">\\(h,H,S_0,\\ldots,S_n,W&#39;,R&#39;\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76b37345e1a3ad95\" href=\"?note=76b37345e1a3ad95\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-self-reference\">89-lem-solovay-self-reference</a> 给出的同一组见证，包含 H 的 PA 内总性、唯一性、有限值域、初值及递归等价，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_j\">\\(S_j\\)</span> 取该 H 的规范极限句。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}[B]=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}[B]=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i=\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle S_j\\mid j\\in W&#39;,\\ iR&#39;j\\rangle\">\\(D_i=\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle S_j\\mid j\\in W&#39;,\\ iR&#39;j\\rangle\\)</span>，按指标递增折叠。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in W^\\prime\">\\(i,j\\in W^\\prime\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 是 PA 的外部标准模型可靠性，最后一项是带此条件的结论。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R\\subseteq W^2\\)</span> 传递、非自反，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)\">\\(\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\">\\(W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\">\\(R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\\)</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)\">\\(\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}limit\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\neg(S_i\\land S_j),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle S_0,\\ldots,S_n\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;iR&#39;j\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_j],\\\\\n&amp;i\\in W\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_i],\\\\\n&amp;i\\in W\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[D_i],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models S_0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}limit\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\neg(S_i\\land S_j),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle S_0,\\ldots,S_n\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;iR&#39;j\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_j],\\\\\n&amp;i\\in W\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_i],\\\\\n&amp;i\\in W\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S_i\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[D_i],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models S_0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bew}[B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})\n\\quad(B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\nJ_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{j\\in W&#39;\\mid iR&#39; j\\}),\\quad\nD_i\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle S_{(J_i)_k}\\mid k&lt;|J_i|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bew}[B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})\n\\quad(B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\nJ_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{j\\in W&#39;\\mid iR&#39; j\\}),\\quad\nD_i\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle S_{(J_i)_k}\\mid k&lt;|J_i|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 128–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书的性质 (2)、(4)–(7)。前五项使用上游可在 PA 内证明的递归等价与总性：有限严格移动给出唯一极限；证明码触发移动给出后继极限句的不可反证性；进入非零世界的有限历史由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性内部化，给出相应可证性结论。完整推导见所引页码。仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models H(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\leftrightarrow h(a)=b\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models H(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\leftrightarrow h(a)=b\\)</span> 的外部图关系不足以支持这些 PA 定理。最后一项是外部论证：若真实极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&gt;0\">\\(j&gt;0\\)</span>，进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 曾由 PA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg S_j\">\\(\\neg S_j\\)</span> 证明触发；可靠性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg S_j\">\\(\\neg S_j\\)</span> 为真，而极限定义使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_j\">\\(S_j\\)</span> 为真，矛盾。因此真实极限是 0。此处不以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 偷换“PA 所证都真”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-sigma-one-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3b78fd5923bcaa6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 